sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Dispatcher
  participant API as API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Worker as Worker and VROOM
  participant Router as Valhalla
  User->>API: Select owned inputs and objective
  API->>DB: Copy inputs and queue job
  Worker->>DB: Claim job
  Worker->>Router: Profile-specific directed matrices
  Worker->>Worker: Solve and reject forbidden arcs
  Worker->>Router: Actual selected route legs
  Worker->>Worker: Recompute and independently validate
  Worker->>DB: Save draft and job result
  User->>API: Edit assignments with current version
  API->>DB: Same plan becomes DRAFT/PENDING
  Worker->>Router: Re-route edited plan
  Worker->>Worker: Validate without optimization
  Worker->>DB: Update same plan at reserved version
  User->>API: Mark current valid result READY
  API->>DB: Check version, inputs and validation
  User->>API: Export current routes
